WEBVTT

01:30.560 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:38.400 --> 01:40.680
It wasn't until this life as Nan Xuyue

01:42.040 --> 01:43.920
that I finally understood

01:45.200 --> 01:46.880
what I was searching for

01:48.280 --> 01:49.600
was you.

01:52.360 --> 01:55.320
I've sought you
through 10,000 years of rebirth.

01:57.040 --> 01:59.120
You have been
in a deep sleep all this time.

02:01.960 --> 02:03.040
But that's fine.

02:07.240 --> 02:09.680
Anyway, in this life,

02:11.920 --> 02:14.200
I have finally found you.

02:28.640 --> 02:29.560
I'll help you heal.

02:31.560 --> 02:33.720
The wounds of a divine body

02:33.800 --> 02:36.840
require half the power of Chaos
to recover.

02:38.400 --> 02:40.240
Are you willing

02:41.480 --> 02:43.160
to pay such a price?

02:57.560 --> 02:59.840
I'm willing to use half my Chaos Power
to help you heal,

03:00.640 --> 03:02.480
not because I trust your words,

03:03.320 --> 03:05.360
but to settle past debts.

03:05.960 --> 03:07.400
From now on,

03:08.120 --> 03:09.280
you and I

03:10.880 --> 03:12.400
will walk our separate paths.

03:55.880 --> 03:57.720
The Immortal Alliance is already
under the Demon Lord's control.

03:57.800 --> 03:59.080
The Demon Lord has declared

03:59.160 --> 04:00.400
that one life must be exchanged
for the Immortal Alliance's survival.

04:01.720 --> 04:03.160
There are only five incense sticks' time.

04:03.240 --> 04:06.120
Each time an incense stick burns out,
the Demon Lord will kill a sect.

04:06.840 --> 04:09.520
Until all five sects of the Immortal
Alliance are completely destroyed.

04:17.800 --> 04:20.480
Tell me, which sect should I start with

04:21.440 --> 04:23.640
as the first incense stick nears its end?

04:25.280 --> 04:26.160
Don't do this.

04:26.240 --> 04:28.680
I'm scared…

04:28.760 --> 04:30.120
If you must kill, kill me!

04:30.200 --> 04:31.320
Don't harm the child!

04:32.000 --> 04:33.200
Noisy.

04:38.800 --> 04:39.840
Bao.

04:40.360 --> 04:42.080
Are… Are you alright?

04:42.600 --> 04:43.440
I'm fine.

04:44.040 --> 04:46.000
The first incense stick has burned out.

04:46.600 --> 04:47.440
Perfect timing.

04:47.520 --> 04:49.360
Let's start with the Osprey Island.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.280
Bao!

05:01.200 --> 05:02.920
You're overestimating your strength!

05:04.800 --> 05:05.680
-Senior!
-Senior!

05:05.760 --> 05:07.160
-Senior!
-Senior!

05:08.280 --> 05:10.360
Aren't you a person of purity?

05:10.440 --> 05:12.800
Even you can be consumed by inner demons.

05:13.320 --> 05:14.720
Truly laughable.

05:15.640 --> 05:17.400
How about I help you?

05:17.480 --> 05:19.280
Why cultivate the immortal path?

05:19.360 --> 05:20.440
Follow the demonic path instead!

05:26.040 --> 05:27.000
Let him go!

05:30.080 --> 05:31.000
Xuanling!

05:34.080 --> 05:35.400
-Master!
-Master!

05:40.320 --> 05:41.440
You've finally come.

05:44.000 --> 05:45.280
Where is Fate?

05:46.520 --> 05:48.400
Since he saved you,

05:49.280 --> 05:50.680
why didn't he follow you along?

05:51.720 --> 05:55.760
Where is the noble Fate
hiding like a coward?

05:55.840 --> 05:57.720
Fate caused Xie Xuechen's death.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.440
I won't walk the same path as him.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.120
This time,

06:01.720 --> 06:03.280
I'm here to surrender to you.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.960
Surrender?

06:06.120 --> 06:07.760
Do you think I'd believe you?

06:08.800 --> 06:10.360
You don't have to believe me.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.960
But you know very well

06:13.680 --> 06:15.680
Fate is an ancient artifact.

06:16.200 --> 06:17.400
You cannot kill him.

06:18.080 --> 06:21.800
But with my help,
you can gain an advantage.

06:21.880 --> 06:24.520
I now offer my own life in exchange.

06:24.600 --> 06:27.080
All I ask is that you spare everyone
in the Immortal Alliance.

06:33.760 --> 06:37.160
You? You have no right
to negotiate with me.

06:38.280 --> 06:40.400
What I want is the power of Chaos.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.760
Xuanling!

06:49.800 --> 06:51.400
Without my willing surrender,

06:51.480 --> 06:53.560
no one can take
the power of Chaos from me.

07:06.200 --> 07:07.800
You're asking for death!

07:09.200 --> 07:10.800
If you kill me,

07:10.880 --> 07:12.560
you'll never obtain the power of Chaos.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.360
Release everyone in the Immortal Alliance,

07:16.880 --> 07:18.720
and I'll return
to the Dark Abyss with you.

07:23.280 --> 07:25.360
Since you've come as promised,

07:26.320 --> 07:28.840
I will spare these nobodies
of the Immortal Alliance.

07:36.840 --> 07:38.600
-Master! Master!
-Senior! Senior!

07:40.520 --> 07:42.840
-Hand over the power of Chaos.
-What exactly are you planning?

07:42.920 --> 07:44.520
Planning?

07:45.880 --> 07:48.960
Naturally, to combine
the power of Chaos with demonic power

07:49.040 --> 07:51.880
to achieve ultimate strength
and destroy this world.

07:55.400 --> 07:58.680
Destroy the world?
What good does that do you?

07:58.760 --> 08:00.400
Good?

08:01.960 --> 08:03.440
It should be punishment instead.

08:04.760 --> 08:08.240
For these 10,000 years,
the world betrayed and abandoned me.

08:09.560 --> 08:10.840
It must pay the price.

08:10.920 --> 08:13.040
But the people of today are no longer
the people of 10,000 years ago.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.880
There's no difference.

08:16.560 --> 08:18.200
Human hearts change easily,

08:18.960 --> 08:20.280
but some things remain the same,

08:21.120 --> 08:25.480
ingratitude, selfishness, and cowardice,
generation after generation.

08:25.560 --> 08:28.720
The Book of Fate altered your memories
and the memories of the world.

08:29.480 --> 08:31.840
Pearl never betrayed you.

08:32.640 --> 08:33.720
And you

08:33.799 --> 08:36.200
were never the Fallen Deity
seeking to destroy the world.

08:37.080 --> 08:39.159
You've always been
Saint Emperor Zhao Ming,

08:39.679 --> 08:42.240
who sacrificed everything for all beings.

08:42.760 --> 08:44.000
All of this is false.

08:44.600 --> 08:46.760
What is true, and what is false?

08:47.880 --> 08:49.200
All I know is,

08:50.600 --> 08:53.600
I've been suppressed
under the Lava for 10,000 years,

08:54.120 --> 08:56.200
suffering day and night.

08:56.800 --> 08:59.040
I've been despised by generations.

09:00.160 --> 09:02.080
And when I was in pain and despair,

09:03.000 --> 09:05.120
you and Xie Xuechen fell in love.

09:06.120 --> 09:08.640
I'm sick of so-called righteousness,

09:09.160 --> 09:11.160
of so-called virtuous constraints.

09:12.440 --> 09:14.400
When that remnant soul

09:15.800 --> 09:17.800
returned to me,

09:20.080 --> 09:23.440
showing me your love
and memories with Xie Xuechen,

09:23.960 --> 09:25.960
it filled me with utter disgust.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.960
Why won't you believe my words?

09:29.000 --> 09:31.240
The truth from 10,000 years ago
is as I've said.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.600
Perhaps

09:33.520 --> 09:35.760
I can help you
return to how you were back then.

09:36.280 --> 09:39.200
Can you let go of everything
and start anew?

09:40.800 --> 09:42.560
Start anew?

09:43.360 --> 09:45.240
The pain, the torment, the scorn
of these 10,000 years

09:45.320 --> 09:47.440
was all borne by me alone.

09:47.520 --> 09:49.040
Let me tell you,

09:49.880 --> 09:53.000
no one has the right
to tell me to easily let go.

09:53.760 --> 09:57.240
And no one has the right to decide for me.

09:57.920 --> 09:58.800
Remember this.

09:59.320 --> 10:01.040
From now on,

10:01.560 --> 10:05.320
there is no Saint Emperor Zhao Ming,
no Beacon of Righteousness Xie Xuechen.

10:05.400 --> 10:06.600
There is only me,

10:07.200 --> 10:08.600
the Demon Lord of Destruction.

10:11.440 --> 10:14.240
Demon Lord, please don't be angry.

10:15.080 --> 10:18.640
Actually, I'd like to transfer
the power of Chaos to you early.

10:19.800 --> 10:23.400
But now, I only possess
half of the power of Chaos.

10:24.040 --> 10:25.360
I must keep it

10:26.040 --> 10:27.840
to recover the other half.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.120
Where is the other half?

10:42.360 --> 10:44.560
This matter cannot be rushed.

10:45.080 --> 10:46.840
Spend some time with me,

10:47.360 --> 10:49.120
let me see your changes,

10:50.120 --> 10:52.800
and I will naturally tell you
where the other half is.

11:02.680 --> 11:04.320
I've sealed your cultivation techniques.

11:04.400 --> 11:07.920
No matter how cunning you are,
you can't escape the Dark Abyss.

11:11.840 --> 11:13.640
Think it over carefully.

11:14.760 --> 11:17.280
Reveal the location
of the other half soon,

11:17.360 --> 11:20.720
and surrender it willingly,
then perhaps I may spare you.

11:20.800 --> 11:24.480
Otherwise, you should be well aware
of the tortures of the Dark Abyss

11:25.800 --> 11:27.480
and the torment of the Lava.

11:38.440 --> 11:41.440
The current Demon Lord
is so ruthless and resolute.

11:41.960 --> 11:44.200
Can he truly be purified and changed?

11:59.520 --> 12:00.560
That's wonderful!

12:00.640 --> 12:02.640
It seems the demonic energy inside him
is being driven out.

12:15.120 --> 12:16.440
Withdraw your power!

12:27.880 --> 12:29.320
Are you alright?

12:31.200 --> 12:32.040
No major issues.

12:32.640 --> 12:34.520
Fortunately, you stopped us in time.

12:34.600 --> 12:37.080
But when we were expelling
the demonic energy from you,

12:37.160 --> 12:40.360
this demonic energy didn't fade.
Instead, it grew stronger.

12:43.120 --> 12:45.320
This demonic energy is indeed peculiar.

12:45.920 --> 12:51.200
Earlier, I felt the forces
of good and evil clashing within me.

12:51.800 --> 12:54.640
The more I tried to expel it,
the more the demonic energy fought back.

12:54.720 --> 12:57.880
It even almost made me
lose control of my techniques.

12:57.960 --> 12:59.200
The Demon Lord is ruthless,

12:59.840 --> 13:01.760
and his demonic energy
is even more cunning.

13:01.840 --> 13:04.920
Senior, let's try again.
We're sure to succeed.

13:09.600 --> 13:12.480
This matter might not be so simple.

13:13.160 --> 13:15.080
Originally, I aimed to reach
the Spiritual Form stage,

13:15.160 --> 13:17.920
enhance my Curse,
and stand against the Dark Abyss.

13:18.680 --> 13:21.680
But now, with the demonic energy
invading my body,

13:22.880 --> 13:24.120
I fear

13:24.720 --> 13:26.360
hope is faint.

13:27.400 --> 13:29.720
I've heard that
His Grace struggles to sleep at night.

13:30.760 --> 13:33.720
If we offer him this aged wine
from the Dark Abyss,

13:33.800 --> 13:35.040
once he drinks it,

13:35.120 --> 13:37.560
he'll surely fall asleep immediately
and have sweet dreams all night.

13:37.640 --> 13:39.320
As they say, fine wine

13:40.360 --> 13:41.600
is the perfect match for a hero.

13:42.160 --> 13:43.440
A perfect pair!

13:44.400 --> 13:49.160
When did you, Anger Demon,
learn to butter up and flatter?

13:49.880 --> 13:51.800
Flatter?

13:51.880 --> 13:54.600
I truly admire His Grace.
Don't you get it?

13:55.360 --> 13:56.920
Hurry up and offer the wine.

13:57.000 --> 13:58.280
His Grace will definitely like it.

13:58.360 --> 14:01.560
Right? I think so too.
Alright, I'm off then.

14:08.320 --> 14:12.360
His Grace refuses to eat anything
and rejects any persuasion.

14:13.280 --> 14:14.440
I bet Anger Demon

14:14.520 --> 14:18.920
will walk out of the Temple of
Divine Execution with the wine untouched.

14:19.760 --> 14:21.280
I don't think so.

14:22.120 --> 14:22.960
I bet

14:23.560 --> 14:25.960
he'll crawl out,
wine and all, chased away.

14:34.680 --> 14:36.720
His Grace actually accepted your wine?

14:37.240 --> 14:40.200
He wasn't inside
the Temple of Divine Execution.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.600
I just left the wine there and came out.

14:43.520 --> 14:45.320
But it's strange.

14:45.400 --> 14:47.880
Every time
I come looking for him at night,

14:47.960 --> 14:49.680
he's never there.

15:04.480 --> 15:07.320
It's all Zhao Ming's fault! He caused
the Divine Clan to abandon humanity.

15:07.400 --> 15:10.440
He made our lives unbearable!
Zhao Ming is an evil emperor!

15:10.520 --> 15:13.720
He is the origin of our disaster,
the beginning of humanity's suffering!

15:13.800 --> 15:15.040
He's nothing but a curse!

15:15.120 --> 15:16.960
Exactly! Just for his own selfish desires,

15:17.040 --> 15:18.960
-We hated him.
-he made mistakes and angered the Divine.

15:19.040 --> 15:21.320
He was never worthy to be our ruler!

15:21.400 --> 15:23.080
Zhao Ming should've died long ago!

15:23.160 --> 15:25.040
Quickly, let's plead with the Divine Clan,

15:25.120 --> 15:27.200
beg for their forgiveness of humanity,
and ask them to continue protecting us!

15:27.280 --> 15:28.560
It's all Zhao Ming's fault
for defying the Divine Clan!

15:28.640 --> 15:31.360
-It's all Zhao Ming's fault!
-That's right. It's all his fault!

15:31.440 --> 15:33.280
-It's all his fault!
-It's all his fault!

15:39.440 --> 15:41.760
Even though my body escaped the Lava,

15:42.280 --> 15:45.560
my soul is still suppressed
by the remnants of the Lava seal.

15:45.640 --> 15:47.920
Night after night,
I still suffer the tortures of the Lava.

15:49.200 --> 15:50.440
Xie Xuechen,

15:51.000 --> 15:53.120
thanks to your Jade Vault restrictions,

15:53.720 --> 15:55.880
every time I commit evil or kill,

15:56.440 --> 15:58.680
I suffer greater backlash and pain.

15:59.200 --> 16:02.200
But you won't trap me for long.

16:02.880 --> 16:07.200
I will repay
this endless pain to the world tenfold.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.120
Jun Tian!

16:10.760 --> 16:11.960
Jun Tian!

16:24.360 --> 16:26.440
Even you only recognize Xie Xuechen

16:26.960 --> 16:28.280
and refuse to return.

16:29.640 --> 16:30.600
Fine.

16:31.960 --> 16:33.200
Very well.

16:40.280 --> 16:43.080
TWILIGHT SPIRIT PAVILION

16:54.080 --> 16:55.360
Xie Xuechen,

16:56.600 --> 17:00.200
will the Immortal Alliance
find peace after tomorrow?

17:00.280 --> 17:02.120
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

17:02.200 --> 17:03.080
No.

17:03.160 --> 17:04.839
Then, will the mortal world improve?

17:05.599 --> 17:06.440
No, it won't.

17:06.520 --> 17:08.599
Then, why do you still charge forward?

17:08.680 --> 17:10.520
Why not just let them fend for themselves?

17:12.200 --> 17:15.839
In your view, the mortal world
is a complete mess, isn't it?

17:19.200 --> 17:20.040
Of course it is.

17:20.760 --> 17:22.359
Amid this Chaos,

17:23.359 --> 17:24.599
haven't you seen even a sliver of hope?

17:25.680 --> 17:27.119
Just a tiny bit?

17:27.920 --> 17:29.040
What hope is that?

17:30.040 --> 17:31.640
If there's even a sliver of hope,

17:32.240 --> 17:33.920
it's not yet time to give up.

17:34.480 --> 17:37.920
Just like that day
when I brought you back to the Snow City.

17:40.720 --> 17:42.840
As long as there's
even a tiny bit of hope,

17:43.480 --> 17:45.240
it's not yet time to give up.

17:46.560 --> 17:47.920
Xie Xuechen,

17:49.040 --> 17:50.200
don't worry.

17:51.200 --> 17:53.200
I will do my utmost

17:53.880 --> 17:55.800
to protect this world.

18:00.520 --> 18:04.080
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

18:26.960 --> 18:28.120
The night is cold.

18:28.200 --> 18:30.920
And your body is weak.
You shouldn't drink wine.

18:32.160 --> 18:33.640
My body's weak?

18:34.760 --> 18:36.440
Look closely at who I am.

18:41.520 --> 18:44.440
I know you're Fate. But does that mean
you're no longer Nan Xuyue?

18:48.240 --> 18:50.560
Nan Xuyue may have his weaknesses,

18:51.360 --> 18:53.240
but Fate is different.

18:54.280 --> 18:55.960
Nan Xuyue is not weak.

18:56.040 --> 18:58.560
He simply had too few fulfilled wishes.

19:00.840 --> 19:02.160
And his pain

19:02.800 --> 19:04.400
results from the decision you made

19:04.920 --> 19:06.440
10,000 years ago.

19:23.080 --> 19:25.920
You like Nan Xuyue, don't you?

19:28.040 --> 19:29.040
No.

19:30.200 --> 19:32.320
No, I don't like him.

19:35.640 --> 19:36.920
Good.

19:40.560 --> 19:42.120
Then I'll pretend

19:42.880 --> 19:44.720
I never asked about that today.

19:46.280 --> 19:47.600
Pack your things.

19:48.640 --> 19:49.760
Prepare to leave.

19:50.280 --> 19:51.120
Where to?

19:51.720 --> 19:53.120
The Snow City.

19:53.200 --> 19:54.400
The Snow City?

19:56.440 --> 19:59.000
That's where the plan concludes.

19:59.600 --> 20:01.960
Naturally, we should
head there a bit early

20:02.520 --> 20:04.760
and make proper preparations.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.440
The Pearl Tower is a magical artifact.

20:10.440 --> 20:11.600
Using it to expel demonic energy

20:12.200 --> 20:13.840
might prove beneficial.

20:47.680 --> 20:50.280
Senior, you're showing signs
of demonic possession!

20:50.360 --> 20:53.000
If this continues, not only
will he fall into demonic possession,

20:53.080 --> 20:54.480
but we'll also be consumed
by the demonic energy.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.960
Senior, stay awake!

20:57.040 --> 20:58.520
Don't let the demonic energy
take control of you!

21:01.880 --> 21:03.920
-Senior!
-Senior!

21:05.720 --> 21:06.800
Hold on.

21:06.880 --> 21:08.080
Hang in there!

21:08.160 --> 21:10.320
In the end, my faith is unsteady.

21:10.400 --> 21:12.480
I can no longer control
the demonic energy within me.

21:13.440 --> 21:15.480
Now, the only way
to give you all a chance at survival

21:15.560 --> 21:17.320
is to destroy my entire cultivation

21:17.840 --> 21:20.280
while my mind still remains intact!

21:21.360 --> 21:24.640
Senior, stop!
You mustn't destroy your cultivation!

21:44.080 --> 21:45.720
Soul Binding Curse!

21:59.560 --> 22:00.880
Execute!

22:10.720 --> 22:14.360
At the Greenview Heights,
a wedding and a funeral held together.

22:14.440 --> 22:17.320
Divine battles shook yin and yang.

22:18.080 --> 22:20.760
The Immortal Alliance
has been aware of such matters.

22:20.840 --> 22:23.360
So now, should I address you as Mr. Nan

22:24.440 --> 22:26.640
or the Divine Emperor of Fate?

22:29.600 --> 22:31.280
As long as our stance aligns,

22:32.040 --> 22:33.560
titles are unimportant.

22:40.600 --> 22:41.960
Then, what is your stance?

22:42.640 --> 22:43.840
Tell me.

22:46.240 --> 22:48.320
The Demon Lord is the enemy of the age.

22:49.160 --> 22:51.760
All should align against him.

22:54.160 --> 22:56.760
The Immortal Alliance
is now at the mercy of him.

22:56.840 --> 22:58.000
But as Fate,

22:58.840 --> 23:02.840
only I can stand against him.

23:07.880 --> 23:10.720
I've expelled the demonic energy from you,

23:11.240 --> 23:13.720
but your act of self-destruction
at the Pearl Tower

23:13.800 --> 23:15.080
has severely damaged
your internal channels.

23:15.160 --> 23:19.080
In the coming days, you must
take spiritual medicine and rest well.

23:21.320 --> 23:23.640
Why do you keep looking at me?

23:24.360 --> 23:25.840
I just wanted to see clearly

23:26.440 --> 23:28.560
what Fate, the one who governs
the destinies of all ages,

23:28.640 --> 23:30.440
truly looks like.

23:32.160 --> 23:33.760
Nan Xuyue's appearance

23:34.280 --> 23:35.760
shouldn't be unfamiliar to you.

23:36.440 --> 23:38.440
I'm referring to the heart.

23:39.760 --> 23:41.320
Does your heart

23:41.840 --> 23:43.640
truly align with the Immortal Alliance?

23:47.360 --> 23:49.560
Since you've chosen to trust me,

23:50.360 --> 23:52.040
then trust me entirely.

23:53.280 --> 23:54.680
And you must trust only me.

24:00.120 --> 24:03.280
This is a medicinal soup
made with our spiritual ginseng.

24:03.360 --> 24:04.560
It will aid in restoring
your internal channels.

24:04.640 --> 24:06.960
Thank you, Miss Feng Yao.

24:13.120 --> 24:14.040
You're so selfless.

24:14.120 --> 24:16.800
To protect
the Immortal Alliance from harm,

24:16.880 --> 24:18.920
you were willing to sacrifice
your cultivation.

24:20.440 --> 24:23.040
For cultivators,
cultivation is the most precious thing.

24:23.800 --> 24:25.360
And with such profound techniques,

24:25.960 --> 24:28.680
were you really going
to give them up so easily?

24:28.760 --> 24:30.960
The disaster was caused by me.

24:31.840 --> 24:33.400
As the Alliance Leader,

24:34.080 --> 24:35.840
I failed to protect everyone

24:36.440 --> 24:38.720
and was instead infused
with demonic energy by the Demon Lord,

24:38.800 --> 24:40.880
nearly harming the innocent.

24:40.960 --> 24:43.160
With my cultivation
tainted by demonic energy,

24:43.760 --> 24:45.440
it's better to destroy it entirely,

24:45.520 --> 24:47.640
leaving no room for sin behind.

24:48.360 --> 24:51.720
And I will not allow myself
to give rise to evil thoughts.

24:57.280 --> 24:59.240
As for good and evil,

24:59.760 --> 25:01.160
right and wrong,

25:01.960 --> 25:04.160
you truly see through it all
without attachment.

25:09.000 --> 25:11.520
My master once said I was pure.

25:11.600 --> 25:13.560
But after all I've been through,

25:14.160 --> 25:15.560
I eventually realized

25:16.160 --> 25:19.600
that my heart still harbored attachments.

25:20.200 --> 25:23.920
That is why the demonic energy
could disturb my techniques.

25:25.520 --> 25:26.920
The problem isn't external.

25:27.600 --> 25:29.120
It's within the heart.

25:32.360 --> 25:33.920
You possess wisdom

25:35.000 --> 25:36.600
to see through attachments.

25:36.680 --> 25:40.400
Breaking through your boundaries
is only a matter of time.

25:41.280 --> 25:44.320
Cultivation is easy to abandon,
but breakthroughs are hard to achieve.

25:44.400 --> 25:45.680
Perhaps…

25:46.680 --> 25:49.360
I just chose the simplest path.

26:02.480 --> 26:03.680
Qiumin.

26:05.840 --> 26:07.000
Are you alright?

26:07.080 --> 26:09.840
-How are you feeling?
-I'm fine.

26:09.920 --> 26:11.760
It feels like
I just woke from a long dream.

26:12.360 --> 26:13.720
I feel the same.

26:13.800 --> 26:15.880
Those were your memories
from 10,000 years ago.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.480
-Mu Xuanling!
-Xie Xuechen!

26:17.560 --> 26:18.400
Mr. Xie!

26:21.160 --> 26:23.160
Fu Lansheng! Are you alright?

26:23.240 --> 26:24.320
I'm fine.

26:25.600 --> 26:27.840
Xie Xuechen, have you gone mad?

26:36.520 --> 26:37.640
Qiumin!

26:39.560 --> 26:42.280
He's not Xie Xuechen. He's the Demon Lord.

26:43.920 --> 26:46.440
Now your lives are in her hands.

26:47.320 --> 26:49.600
The power of Chaos or their lives,

26:49.680 --> 26:51.040
what will you choose?

26:51.120 --> 26:54.240
I will give you the power of Chaos,
but not now.

26:54.320 --> 26:56.360
We're deep in the Dark Abyss now.

26:56.440 --> 27:00.280
If I hand over it too early,
it will become our death warrant.

27:03.160 --> 27:06.400
Ten thousand years ago,
all the people betrayed you,

27:07.080 --> 27:08.920
but Yan and Qingyang didn't.

27:09.520 --> 27:12.600
They could have achieved
true freedom and happiness,

27:12.680 --> 27:16.360
but they chose to return to the palace,
only to die in the chaos of battle.

27:16.440 --> 27:20.240
You may be ruthless, but I believe
you still value righteousness.

27:20.880 --> 27:23.920
I've spared them until now
out of respect for the fact

27:24.440 --> 27:26.240
that they died for Zhao Ming.

27:26.320 --> 27:30.040
But if you still refuse
to hand over the power of Chaos,

27:30.120 --> 27:32.120
I don't mind letting them die once more.

27:38.840 --> 27:39.840
What are you doing?

27:40.480 --> 27:42.000
Since they insist on seeking death,

27:42.080 --> 27:44.360
then let them taste
the torments of the Lava.

27:46.680 --> 27:47.880
-Lansheng!
-Qiumin!

27:48.920 --> 27:50.560
No one can survive
more than three days in the Lava.

27:50.640 --> 27:53.840
-How could they endure it?
-Then, hand over the power of Chaos.

28:01.120 --> 28:03.040
Or just leave them there.

28:03.120 --> 28:06.440
Xie Xuechen survived for seven days.
Perhaps they can too.

28:06.520 --> 28:08.080
You're toying with lives.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.960
Ten thousand years ago,

28:10.480 --> 28:12.360
when I cherished life,

28:12.880 --> 28:15.480
the world didn't value my protection.

28:15.560 --> 28:19.120
When they begged the Divine Clan for
mercy, bowing and confessing their sins,

28:19.200 --> 28:21.800
they willingly chose
to have their lives toyed with.

28:23.720 --> 28:25.160
Mu Xuanling!

28:25.240 --> 28:26.080
Xuechen is gone,

28:27.160 --> 28:29.280
but the Demon Lord has taken his soul.

28:29.800 --> 28:32.120
May the ancestors
of the Snow City protect us

28:32.640 --> 28:34.480
and help humanity survive this crisis.

28:34.560 --> 28:36.880
One crisis isn't over
before another begins.

28:37.480 --> 28:39.880
Now the Divine Emperor of Fate
guards the Snow City.

28:40.720 --> 28:42.080
Though he can stand
against the Demon Lord,

28:42.160 --> 28:44.160
his intentions are mysterious.

28:44.760 --> 28:46.040
Where the Immortal Alliance's path

28:46.760 --> 28:48.000
will lead?

28:48.080 --> 28:50.920
We can only take it step by step.

28:52.160 --> 28:53.920
If Xuechen were still here,

28:54.600 --> 28:56.000
he could surely resolve this crisis.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.720
Actually,

29:00.800 --> 29:02.480
even now,

29:03.680 --> 29:06.080
I still believe that Senior remains
within the Demon Lord.

29:06.160 --> 29:09.080
Perhaps there's still a chance
to awaken him.

29:23.320 --> 29:25.680
The Immortal Alliance
claims to be open and upright,

29:25.760 --> 29:27.800
yet you resort to such sneaky actions?

29:30.920 --> 29:33.000
Are you here to surrender yourself?

29:34.480 --> 29:35.320
Where is Mr. Xie?

29:35.920 --> 29:38.560
Xie Xuechen is long dead.

29:38.640 --> 29:42.360
The current ruler of the Dark Abyss
is the Demon Lord.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.680
My Senior has not perished.

29:46.480 --> 29:49.280
He's merely been controlled
by the Demon Lord.

29:52.000 --> 29:53.080
Stubborn fool.

29:53.160 --> 29:54.000
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

29:54.080 --> 29:55.000
Your Grace,

29:55.600 --> 29:59.080
this disciple of the Snow City
invaded the Dark Abyss with ill intent.

29:59.160 --> 30:00.680
I caught him on the spot.

30:02.360 --> 30:04.960
I spared your lives
that day in the Snow City,

30:05.760 --> 30:07.520
and today you come seeking death?

30:07.600 --> 30:08.480
Senior,

30:09.000 --> 30:11.000
I know your soul hasn't been destroyed.

30:11.520 --> 30:14.800
You must've had your body and mind
controlled by him!

30:14.880 --> 30:17.680
I've come here fully prepared to die.

30:18.440 --> 30:21.880
Even if it means sacrificing myself today,
I will awaken you!

30:23.400 --> 30:24.640
How utterly foolish.

30:25.440 --> 30:26.280
Senior,

30:27.240 --> 30:29.240
we grew up together.

30:29.320 --> 30:30.640
No one knows you better than I do.

30:31.440 --> 30:33.520
Since childhood,
you've shouldered the world's burden.

30:33.600 --> 30:35.560
Slaying evil
has been your lifelong ambition.

30:35.640 --> 30:38.640
How can you now
be controlled by this vile demon?

30:39.400 --> 30:41.080
Think of your father's last words.

30:41.680 --> 30:43.720
Everyone in the Immortal Alliance
is waiting for you.

30:43.800 --> 30:45.480
The people of the world need you.

30:45.560 --> 30:46.800
Wake up now!

30:47.920 --> 30:49.920
Destroy this cruel and vile demon.

30:50.000 --> 30:52.480
Don't let him destroy the world
you gave your life to protect!

30:57.920 --> 30:59.640
You're asking for death.

31:01.480 --> 31:02.880
Senior…

31:03.400 --> 31:07.360
my life was given by you.

31:08.160 --> 31:10.320
When I was severely wounded,

31:10.400 --> 31:13.160
you transferred your energy to me,

31:13.680 --> 31:14.880
saving my life.

31:16.040 --> 31:18.520
Now, if my life

31:19.040 --> 31:20.800
can awaken you,

31:22.000 --> 31:23.200
I…

31:23.960 --> 31:26.400
will have died for a worthy cause.

31:28.680 --> 31:30.440
Compared to death,

31:31.640 --> 31:33.520
you may still have some value in living.

31:35.000 --> 31:36.600
Imprison him!

31:37.640 --> 31:41.120
I've called you both here
to discuss something.

31:41.640 --> 31:44.120
I hope to borrow the Celestial Artifact,
the Black Wood Seal,

31:44.200 --> 31:45.160
from the Jade Sky Palace.

31:45.240 --> 31:47.800
It's a powerful tool for reinforcing
arrays and sealing energies.

31:48.600 --> 31:49.520
What do you need it for?

31:49.600 --> 31:52.000
I have my reasons. No need to ask further.

31:52.080 --> 31:53.440
The Jade Sky Palace
does have the Black Wood Seal,

31:53.520 --> 31:56.040
but it is a rare treasure.

31:56.120 --> 31:58.440
Only the past masters
knew the location of it.

31:58.520 --> 32:00.920
Now that Lansheng is gone,
no one knows its whereabouts.

32:01.000 --> 32:02.160
By the way,

32:02.760 --> 32:05.240
Bao is a Treasure Sniffer.
Perhaps she could find it.

32:05.320 --> 32:07.880
-Don't even think about using Bao!
-I can try!

32:10.080 --> 32:11.320
-Bao.
-I can try…

32:11.400 --> 32:12.720
-What are you doing?
-Bao!

32:12.800 --> 32:14.880
This is a matter for adults.
You can't get involved.

32:15.720 --> 32:17.800
Let me down. I'm going to try!

32:18.640 --> 32:21.000
Lansheng, Xuanling, and Miss Gao

32:21.080 --> 32:23.240
are all in danger.

32:23.320 --> 32:26.160
I should do my part to help!

32:28.640 --> 32:29.920
Let me go!

32:36.360 --> 32:37.880
As Treasure Sniffers,

32:37.960 --> 32:42.240
we can not only detect treasures but also
tell whether a person is good or bad.

32:43.160 --> 32:45.040
Yet with you, we can't figure it out.

32:46.600 --> 32:50.560
Before, when you were Mr. Nan,
I couldn't tell.

32:50.640 --> 32:54.560
And now, as Fate, I still can't tell.

32:57.560 --> 33:01.280
Because fate is heartless,
knowing neither good nor evil.

33:01.880 --> 33:03.000
Everything

33:04.440 --> 33:06.080
is already destined.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.200
Qiumin!

33:10.640 --> 33:11.520
Qiumin!

33:23.760 --> 33:25.160
Qiumin…

33:25.240 --> 33:29.080
They say no one can survive
more than three days in the Lava.

33:29.880 --> 33:32.840
I don't know
how much longer we can hold on.

33:34.760 --> 33:38.240
Once, the Lava was used
to imprison the Fallen Deity.

33:39.520 --> 33:41.520
Now that the Fallen Deity is gone,

33:41.600 --> 33:45.960
the fury that lashes at us every hour
should be less, right?

33:46.840 --> 33:48.480
Perhaps we can last longer.

33:49.520 --> 33:50.360
Maybe…

33:51.920 --> 33:54.200
we can compete with Xie Xuechen
from back then.

33:55.080 --> 33:56.800
Ten thousand years ago,

33:58.920 --> 34:03.240
whether amidst the fire or the rebellion,
you protected me with your life.

34:03.320 --> 34:05.800
When I fell into the time swirl,
you followed without hesitation,

34:07.160 --> 34:08.920
ready to sacrifice your life.

34:10.360 --> 34:14.400
Now, in this desperate Lava,
you've never thought of abandoning me.

34:16.840 --> 34:19.840
I want to ask you. Why is that?

34:21.040 --> 34:22.920
Because I love you.

34:26.480 --> 34:28.159
In the war between humans and spirits,

34:28.760 --> 34:30.560
there was the regret
of my parents' sacrifice.

34:31.440 --> 34:32.360
Ten thousand years ago,

34:33.440 --> 34:35.719
there was the regret
of Yan and Qingyang's tragic end.

34:37.320 --> 34:39.199
Since coming out of the time swirl,

34:39.880 --> 34:42.080
I've always had a voice in my heart.

34:42.760 --> 34:43.880
It tells me…

34:46.120 --> 34:48.199
that I must hold on
to the person I love in front of me.

34:54.400 --> 34:56.560
I don't know when it started,

34:58.240 --> 34:59.680
but when I see you smile,

35:00.680 --> 35:02.040
I feel happy.

35:03.440 --> 35:06.400
When I see you sad, I feel sorrow.

35:07.360 --> 35:08.360
Qiumin,

35:11.400 --> 35:13.280
weather in our past or present lives,

35:15.160 --> 35:17.200
I truly love you.

35:26.000 --> 35:27.280
From childhood to now,

35:27.800 --> 35:30.560
everyone has hoped
that I do everything perfectly.

35:31.080 --> 35:35.920
But only you have repeatedly helped me
in my imperfect, awkward moments,

35:36.680 --> 35:38.640
even risking yourself to save me.

35:40.600 --> 35:44.400
It's you who taught me
what it means to be loved,

35:44.480 --> 35:46.480
what unconditional love is.

35:47.640 --> 35:51.360
It's you who taught me to accept love
and to give love in return.

35:53.200 --> 35:54.600
If this time,

35:55.520 --> 35:57.360
we can survive this crisis,

35:58.760 --> 36:00.360
from now on,

36:02.800 --> 36:04.720
I'll guard and protect you.

36:06.280 --> 36:08.000
It's settled then.

36:10.000 --> 36:11.080
For the rest of my life,

36:13.080 --> 36:14.800
I'll rely on you, my heroic lady.

36:16.920 --> 36:18.080
Alright.

36:36.440 --> 36:38.040
The Demon Lord is ruthless.

36:38.120 --> 36:40.760
He definitely won't give up
until he gets the power of Chaos.

36:41.480 --> 36:43.560
Gao Qiumin and Fu Lansheng

36:44.080 --> 36:46.000
have been trapped in the Lava for a day.

36:46.520 --> 36:48.600
If this continues,
their lives may be in danger.

36:49.120 --> 36:51.160
I must think of a way
to rescue them quickly.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.680
I heard last night,
a disciple from the Snow City

36:54.760 --> 36:56.440
was captured by His Grace and imprisoned.

36:56.520 --> 36:58.680
Yes. Last night, I passed by the prison

36:58.760 --> 37:01.680
and heard the continuous screams
of that Snow City disciple.

37:01.760 --> 37:04.440
It was terrifying.
I got so scared that I ran away.

37:04.960 --> 37:08.240
With His Grace's ruthlessness,
I'm afraid he doesn't have much time left.

37:13.640 --> 37:14.760
Yan Tong!

37:15.720 --> 37:16.920
Mu Xuanling?

37:18.040 --> 37:19.200
How did you…

37:21.440 --> 37:22.800
How did you end up here?

37:23.520 --> 37:24.680
I came here willingly.

37:24.760 --> 37:27.560
I want to awaken Senior's soul
inside the Demon Lord.

37:29.160 --> 37:31.080
Why bring this suffering upon yourself?

37:31.800 --> 37:34.080
Has he hurt you?

37:34.160 --> 37:35.880
He hasn't hurt me.

37:35.960 --> 37:38.760
He learned that
I have Senior's energy inside me,

37:39.280 --> 37:40.800
so he locked me up here.

37:41.600 --> 37:44.840
Last night, he continuously injected
his demonic energy into me,

37:44.920 --> 37:45.880
seemingly…

37:47.240 --> 37:49.200
to relieve some kind of pain.

37:49.280 --> 37:51.640
The Demon Lord feels pain?

37:53.600 --> 37:56.680
And he was using your body
to circulate his energy?

37:57.360 --> 37:58.600
What exactly is he trying to do?

38:00.360 --> 38:02.320
I don't know his intentions,

38:04.680 --> 38:05.840
but when his demonic energy circulated,

38:06.600 --> 38:08.760
I sensed a strong Jade Vault aura.

38:08.840 --> 38:10.160
This is proof!

38:10.680 --> 38:11.680
I believe

38:12.200 --> 38:14.000
Senior is still inside the Demon Lord.
His soul hasn't dissolved.

38:15.160 --> 38:17.960
Given time, I'm sure I can awaken him.

38:19.000 --> 38:20.920
But based only on the Jade Vault aura,

38:21.800 --> 38:23.320
it's difficult to draw a conclusion.

38:26.120 --> 38:27.280
Before coming here,

38:27.360 --> 38:29.440
I borrowed the Heart-Observing Seal
from the Xuantian Sect.

38:29.520 --> 38:31.440
Since our sect was taken over
by the Dark Clan,

38:31.520 --> 38:34.600
Senior has been studying curses,
creating the Heart-Observing Seal.

38:35.440 --> 38:36.480
It not only reveals inner demons,

38:36.560 --> 38:38.040
but also allows us
to observe the true heart of a soul.

38:38.560 --> 38:40.640
If I have the chance
to explore the Demon Lord's true heart,

38:40.720 --> 38:42.080
everything will become clear.

38:42.880 --> 38:44.280
Observing heart…

38:57.520 --> 38:58.880
It might be worth a try.

38:59.400 --> 39:01.080
Take care of yourself.

39:10.360 --> 39:12.960
Thank you, Miss Feng Yao,
for personally delivering the medicine.

39:13.040 --> 39:15.880
It's nothing. As long as you recover soon.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.360
Thank you.

39:18.120 --> 39:19.240
Try it.

39:35.000 --> 39:36.520
The taste of this dried fruit

39:37.600 --> 39:38.840
feels somewhat familiar.

39:41.520 --> 39:42.400
Have you eaten it before?

39:44.120 --> 39:45.600
It's just a feeling.

39:47.120 --> 39:48.440
Eleven years ago,

39:48.960 --> 39:50.920
Master saved me from an evil cultivator.

39:51.720 --> 39:56.320
At that time, I had already lost
all my previous memories.

40:01.880 --> 40:03.560
What's your name?

40:05.040 --> 40:06.200
Where is your family?

40:08.760 --> 40:11.520
Master also thought about
helping me find my family,

40:12.120 --> 40:14.320
but apart from the clothes I wore,

40:14.960 --> 40:16.960
all I had was a bag of children's snacks.

40:17.960 --> 40:19.240
The clues were too few.

40:19.840 --> 40:21.880
Finding them was nearly impossible.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.320
So, I let it go.

40:29.720 --> 40:31.880
I'm sorry. I don't know why,

40:31.960 --> 40:34.880
but when I see you, I end up saying more.

40:36.680 --> 40:37.920
It's fine if you don't remember.

40:38.640 --> 40:40.160
Without the joy of obtaining,

40:40.240 --> 40:42.160
there's no pain of losing.

40:45.640 --> 40:47.080
Miss Feng Yao,

40:47.160 --> 40:48.600
did you make this dried fruit yourself?

40:51.400 --> 40:54.000
Yes. An elder sister taught me.

40:54.920 --> 40:57.840
Unfortunately, she is already dead.

40:59.120 --> 41:00.720
She died on a rainy night.

41:06.000 --> 41:07.840
Life is unpredictable.

41:09.040 --> 41:11.280
Rest well. I'll leave first.

41:26.000 --> 41:29.080
HALL OF SAINTS

41:29.160 --> 41:32.200
Yes, life is unpredictable.

41:32.960 --> 41:34.600
When it's time to let go,

41:34.680 --> 41:36.120
then let go.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.640
Your family

41:39.360 --> 41:42.800
must wish for your health and safety.

41:51.920 --> 41:53.760
I've heard that the eldest son
of the Greenview Heights

41:53.840 --> 41:57.720
is highly skilled in medicine and can
save lives from the hands of demons.

41:58.240 --> 42:01.520
Miss, this is the only method we can try.

42:01.600 --> 42:04.960
Yuan, I'm going to
the Greenview Heights for your medicine.

42:05.040 --> 42:06.440
You must wait for me to return.

42:06.520 --> 42:07.880
GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

42:09.840 --> 42:10.760
Here.

42:11.280 --> 42:13.680
It's so bitter.

42:13.760 --> 42:14.840
Try this.

42:15.360 --> 42:16.520
Here.

42:18.520 --> 42:19.520
Is it delicious?

42:20.160 --> 42:21.360
Delicious!

42:26.320 --> 42:27.520
What are you doing?

42:36.680 --> 42:38.480
May you live well

42:39.320 --> 42:40.880
under the sunlight.
